  2976	## D250 · 2026-10-31 · Four evidence boundaries and the counting unit settled; the ruler is fixed before any further measurement (standard version 5)
  2977	
  2978	- Alex, on the ruler check of the not-kept statements role-v63 keeps (`research/2026-10-30-noise/ruler-check-2026-10-31.md`; a blind reader agreed with the gold on 93–95% of the controls and on 70% of the entries v63 kept) and the five places put to him with a lean each: "五处都按你的倾向定，计数单位也改; 你要修正尺子；你已经多次因为尺子标准问题陷入假的测量".
  2979	- Decided (each is the lean he was given):
  2980	  1. **An arrangement retold without a new step** (Nokia AI-RAN collaboration, a carmaker's model on the platform, labs using a system): the lean as put: "只描述一个现成安排、没有新动作的，算背景，不收". An arrangement the item only describes as already in place (a collaboration, a customer using a product, a deployment), with no new step, is background and not kept, even when the item gives no date; everything else under the retelling row (D243 item 6, "看不出是旧事的不算重提") is judged as before, and guidance and a forecast or plan still in force keep their weight when retold.
  2981	  2. **How close another company's matter must be** (a lidar maker's price cut, a partner's reactor going critical): the lean as put: "说不出它通过需求、供给、竞争、定价这类路径动了英伟达哪个问题的，不收". Another company's matter that one cannot say moves a question about the company through a path such as demand, supply, competition or pricing is not kept; a party next to the company only by sharing an article, an event or an ecosystem is not kept.
  2982	  3. **A comparison the company, a partner or a third party publishes** ("10x lower cost than closed models", "40% more GPUs in the same power budget", a third party's test): the lean as put: "标准只说'对手拿来和本公司比'的要按 5.1 判；其余的都算产品细节，不收". A partner's or customer's adoption or integration in the same sentence is not dropped by this rule and is judged by 5.1 as before (the lean says nothing about it; an unconditional keep would be a new rule); ruling 4 (a competitor's 2.4x, supporting) unchanged.
  2983	  4. **A named analyst's view of a new event** ("a Kyber delay widens the window for alternatives"): the lean as put: "只是解读一件已经记下的事、没有新事实或推算的，不收". One that adds a new fact or calculation is judged by 5.1; the conditional valuation (5.3) is unchanged.
  2984	  5. **The counting unit**: the lean as put: "只有当那条记录本身不是该留的事，才算留了杂音". A not-kept gold entry counts as kept only when the record that carries it is not itself the same matter as a core, supporting or optional gold entry (optional is never penalised); not-kept words that ride inside the quote of a kept matter are one record of that matter ("一件事用几句话说仍是一条", standard §2).
